{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Authenticate cross-execution reference frames.** Invoke input is caller-controlled, so the claimed producer context, reference, and digest do not authorize access; a forged or leaked reference could load another execution's or tenant's payload from shared storage. Require a signed/MACed capability or service-attested source and tenant validation, and add forged-reference and cross-tenant rejection tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7poeHf","finding_digest":"07c17891beaef2cdce8b082fed3ec52e153ba1790902b74f69a2cbd49d8b5cf0","finding_id":"arf_v1_a7axren6v3zm3tulbax62pwffy","finding_key":"docs/adr/006-java-payload-offloading.md::chained-invoke-envelope::producer-authentication","identity_key":"docs/adr/006-java-payload-offloading.md::chained-invoke-envelope::producer-authentication","line":344,"observation_digest":"5788ffe1ed1ac7bdf643bce9f533a572e0192add3fce583e5e467eb05b05ab08","observation_id":"aro_v1_k6ep7ypndld335sdxtu7km5fol","path":"docs/adr/006-java-payload-offloading.md","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-02T23:40:23Z","review_id":"arr_v1_y5glwmc4oneokxagbuao6qqlil","reviewed_base_sha":"54b01c910cb06c69336afcb2c5f3f220fbe7b0b0","reviewed_head_sha":"4c6822cc220948aebb437a95ebe6acc0cb1c2175","reviewer":"codex","start_line":342,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":678},"record_id":"art_v1_u3yo7iaizg73cqzx2ysa3obuip","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-02T23:40:23Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
